#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:5 0947719b5e2a4802a34dd975df36e02a
msgid "CBUnmanned H743 Stamp"
msgstr "CBUnmanned H743 Stamp"

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:7 958fcdcd4ebf40b8a331e0c3a1d0db3d
msgid ""
"The `CBUnmanned H743 Stamp <https://cbunmanned.com/store>`_ is a flight "
"controller loosely based on the FMUv6 standards & is designed for low volume"
" OEMs as a drop in way to add ArduPilot to their custom hardware builds. It "
"is a part of CBUnmanned's wider `\"Stamp\" Eco-System "
"<https://wiki.cbunmanned.com/wiki/cbunmanned-stamp-eco-system>`_ , which "
"brings together all the typical avionics hardware into a neat custom carrier"
" PCB. Mounting footprints and symbols are available along with examples of "
"basic usage on the  `Wiki <https://wiki.cbunmanned.com/wiki/cbunmanned-"
"stamp-eco-system/h743-flight-controller>`_."
msgstr ""
"`CBUnmanned H743 Stamp <https://cbunmanned.com/store>`_ 是一款飞控，参考 FMUv6 "
"标准设计，面向小批量 OEM 客户，可直接集成到其自定义硬件中以添加 ArduPilot 支持。它是 CBUnmanned 「Stamp」 "
"生态系统（`'Stamp' Eco-System <https://wiki.cbunmanned.com/wiki/cbunmanned-stamp-"
"eco-system>`_）的一部分，将所有典型航电硬件集成到一块定制载板上。安装封装和符号，以及基本使用示例可在 `Wiki "
"<https://wiki.cbunmanned.com/wiki/cbunmanned-stamp-eco-system/h743-flight-"
"controller>`_ 上找到。"

