#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:88 deac71a1a32445cda7b1de6da95be29c
msgid ""
"RC input is configured on the USART 6 Rx Pin. This pin allows all "
"unidirectional RC protocols supported by ArduPilot. PPM is NOT supported. "
"USART 6 Tx is available for use with bi-directional protocols, such as "
"CRSF/ELRS."
msgstr ""
"RC 输入配置在 USART 6 Rx 引脚上。该引脚支持 ArduPilot 所支持的所有单向 RC 协议，不支持 PPM。USART 6 Tx "
"可用于双向协议（如 CRSF/ELRS）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:90 6f56d9e9f826439fa228a233bd48baf7
msgid ""
"An optional IOMCU can be connected to this serial port, but a compatible "
"custom build of the firmware would be required."
msgstr "可选连接 IOMCU 至此串口，但需要专门定制的固件版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:93 f92ecf639b5a4763a3e680f641b1b11c
