msgstr "CAN 接口（浅绿色淡入）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:95 37589bd50da04b61b432544888a22ff4
msgid ""
"2 CAN buses are available, each with a built in 120 ohm termination "
"resistors."
msgstr "2 路 CAN 总线，每路内置 120 欧姆终端电阻。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:98 665a1068204c4ae8821945aabd5954ad
