msgid "I2C 3 - External With internal 2.2k Pull Up."
msgstr "I2C 3 - 外部，内置 2.2k 上拉电阻。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:101 b12aab7e982f462e9822d0774aa5126f
msgid "I2C 4 - External With internal 2.2k Pull Up."
msgstr "I2C 4 - 外部，内置 2.2k 上拉电阻。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:104 aba62113d7984447b5b4d724d7743f80
msgid "SPI (Cyan Fade)"
msgstr "SPI（青色淡入）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:106 0383fdae704844ccb9d9aa1e142e1037
msgid ""
"SPI 4 is available for use with external sensors alongside a Chip Select and"
" Data Ready pin using custom built firwmare."
msgstr "SPI 4 可用于连接外部传感器，附带片选和数据就绪引脚，需使用自定义固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:109 d1f849da4a1e48d58650bcec31ea44fb
msgid "PWM Output (Blue Fade)"
msgstr "PWM 输出（蓝色淡入）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:111 38199f950a1d44f2aa5b89d97fbba62b
msgid ""
"The Stamp supports up to 10 PWM outputs with D-Shot. The PWM outputs are in "
"3 groups:"
msgstr "Stamp 支持最多 10 路带 DShot 的 PWM 输出，分为 3 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:113 40201d6e028a4dafb8edda9d328c1ee4
msgid "PWM 1 - 4 in group 1 (Timer 5)"
msgstr "PWM 1-4 为第 1 组（定时器 5）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:114 6dd3606a00974885b0c1ea9952235412
msgid "PWM 5 - 8 in group 2 (Timer 4)"
msgstr "PWM 5-8 为第 2 组（定时器 4）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:115 be8ae077a75f47ea8aa704408e30e425
msgid "PWM 9 & 10 in group 3 (Timer 2)"
msgstr "PWM 9 和 10 为第 3 组（定时器 2）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:117 ff918eae5dff49e88e6eb9dbdd279948
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any "
"channel in a group uses D-Shot then all channels in the group need to use "
"D-Shot. BiDirectional DShot available on the first 8 outputs."
msgstr ""
"同组内的通道必须使用相同的输出频率。若某组中任一通道使用 DShot，则该组所有通道均须使用 DShot。前 8 路输出支持双向 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:121 eb350bc815fa4817b46907fa0930a095
msgid "Analog Inputs (Purple Fade)"
msgstr "模拟输入（紫色淡入）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:123 154e0106ad3642ae8ec8f1ad5371e6cc
msgid ""
"The board has two ADC input channels for Voltage (0-3.3v) and Current "
"(0-3.3v) measurement. Settings are dependent on the external hardware used."
msgstr "该板有两路 ADC 输入通道，分别用于电压（0-3.3V）和电流（0-3.3V）测量。具体设置取决于所用外部硬件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:126 53c3c6416711434384fa245e220f36db
msgid "Ethernet (Green Fade)"
msgstr "以太网（绿色淡入）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:128 471f4e23354041cc96bdf55748c65e65
msgid ""
"Ethernet is available on 4 output pads and has internal magnetics supporting"
" direct connection to external equipment, no need for a large RJ45 "
"connector."
msgstr "以太网通过 4 个输出焊盘引出，内置磁耦，支持直接连接外部设备，无需大型 RJ45 连接器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:131 ef668153cfba4de496875a8110077b68
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:133 7cb5560512b54186978d09d7ab76c576
msgid ""
"The H743 Stamp has a built in compass, the BMM150. Due to potential "
"interference the board is usually used with an external I2C or CAN compass "
"as part of a GPS/Compass combination."
msgstr "H743 Stamp 内置罗盘 BMM150。由于可能存在干扰，该板通常配合外部 I2C 或 CAN 罗盘（作为 GPS/罗盘组合）使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:136 1ccb23f0b86a4846b603d36d56510dd7
msgid "USB"
msgstr "USB"

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:138 23157f0b8622449b8adcee71cb317739
msgid ""
"USB Signals D+ & D- are available to route to a suitable connector for your "
"project."
msgstr "USB 信号 D+ 和 D- 可引出至适合您项目的连接器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:141 55086c8e2440423db2cdb4b426b8dea4
msgid "Safety Button"
msgstr "安全按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:143 a10f9dcf5cad49cba1f455ba993501fc
msgid ""
"Optional, if it is not fitted remove the check from arming mask. To activate"
" short this pad to 3.3v with a momentary push button (Press & Hold)."
msgstr "可选项。若未安装，请在解锁掩码中取消相关检查。激活方式：使用瞬时按钮（按住）将此焊盘短接至 3.3V。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:146 af3cfa452d2d4bf5b8071f2b5e776abc
msgid "Power"
msgstr "电源"

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:148 567bc28a0a4243159a52c24f621ff81b
msgid ""
"A regulated 3.3v output is available from the stamp for use with the safety "
"button. WARNING! This is shared with the main IC - Do NOT use for "
"accessories. Keep current draw under 0.1A!"
msgstr "Stamp 提供一路稳压 3.3V 输出，供安全按钮使用。警告！该输出与主 IC 共享——请勿用于其他外设，电流不得超过 0.1A！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:150 8985932e56594a0ab1f4ba8401ac57a6
msgid ""
"The Stamp requires a stable 5v supply input of at least 1.5A. This directly "
"powers the 5v components and supplies the 3.3v LDOs with power. Typical idle"
" usage is 0.35A @ 5v."
msgstr ""
"Stamp 需要稳定的 5V、至少 1.5A 供电。该电源直接驱动 5V 器件，并为 3.3V LDO 供电。典型空载电流约为 0.35A @ 5V。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:153 ea987f5b6e7f4c80bc3af7f37b6aefe3
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:155 7a9d9193572f416d9c07144e494c0504
msgid ""
"The board has a built-in voltage sensor via the ``Voltage Sense`` pin, but "
"no internal current sensor. An external current sensor can be connected to "
"the ``Current Sense`` pin. Default parameters for both internal voltage and "
"external current monitoring are set by default to the below :"
msgstr ""
"该板通过 ``Voltage Sense`` 引脚内置电压传感器，但无内部电流传感器。外部电流传感器可连接至 ``Current Sense`` "
"引脚。内部电压和外部电流监测的默认参数如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:157 c48b0a01828c4eb8a7e3998d9222bc4d
msgid ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` 4"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` 4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:158 8fbf4fbb2ab84737843d2a60a5414b93
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 18"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 18"

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:159 b4978b922fc6474dbc815e399233333f
msgid ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 19"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 19"

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:160 03f3c6def36f4f198b5d0ea6a489533c
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 11.1"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 11.1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:161 0d45667dead14a6991d4bfdb1e1e9d9a
msgid ":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 64"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 64"

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:164 40bd735d5deb482da6a5e46e0b03baf6
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:166 3f7f1698630f48e9a5c84dc4250e5bdf
msgid ""
"The board comes pre-installed with an ArduPilot compatible bootloader, "
"allowing the loading of \\*.apj firmware files with any ArduPilot compatible"
" ground station."
msgstr "该飞控板预装了兼容 ArduPilot 的引导程序，可使用任何 ArduPilot 兼容地面站加载 \\*.apj 固件文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:168 720f7221d6464b8c8e6b369573ee7a69
